| Rollback time | 25 min of panic | 30 seconds, one command | 50x faster |
| API P95 during deploy | Spikes to 2.4s | Flat 380ms | No spike |
| Opcache hit rate after deploy | 0 percent for 10 min | 98 percent in 40s | Preloaded |

